---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { webPageJsonLd } from '../lib/seo';
import { LEGAL_LAST_UPDATED } from '../site.config.mjs';

// All wording from docs/submission-copy-v0.3.md (Privacy Notice).
// The company's Chinese legal name may appear on the legal pages only (owner-approved, CLAUDE.md).
const path = '/privacy/';
const title = 'Privacy Notice | Harborwish';
const h1 = 'Privacy Notice';
const description =
  'How Harborwish handles personal data: no accounts, no ads, no tracking cookies. What we collect, why, who we share it with, and your rights.';
---

<Base
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalPath={path}
  jsonLd={webPageJsonLd(Astro.site!, path, h1, description)}
>
  <article class="prose legal">
    <h1>{h1}</h1>
    <p class="last-updated"><em>Last updated: {LEGAL_LAST_UPDATED}</em></p>

    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>Shenyang Ruandi Technology Co., Ltd (<span lang="zh-Hans">沈阳软嘀科技有限公司</span>), registered address Room 7-8387, 7th Floor, No. 39-4 Chuangxin 2nd Road, Taoxian Subdistrict, Shenyang Area of China (Liaoning) Pilot Free Trade Zone, Shenyang, Liaoning Province, China, 110179 (“we”, “us”), operates harborwish.com (the “Site”) under the Harborwish™ brand. We are the controller of the personal data described in this notice. Privacy contact: <a href="mailto:hello@harborwish.com">hello@harborwish.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>2. The short version</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don’t have accounts, ads, or tracking scripts, and we don’t set cookies of our own.</li>
      <li>We handle only the data we need to run the Site, answer your messages, and deliver what you buy.</li>
      <li>We don’t sell your personal data.</li>
      <li>We don’t currently collect quiz answers. Before we start collecting any additional personal data, we will update this notice.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. What we collect, why, and on what basis</h2>
    <p><strong>Technical request data when you visit the Site.</strong> When you load a page, your IP address, browser and device type, the page requested, and the time of the request are processed by our hosting provider, Cloudflare, so the Site can be delivered, kept secure, and protected from abuse. We don’t use this data to profile you. Basis: our legitimate interests in running and securing the Site.</p>
    <p><strong>Messages you send us.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you choose to tell us. We use it to reply and to keep a record of the conversation. Basis: our legitimate interests in answering you and, where your message concerns a purchase, performing our contract with you.</p>
    <p><strong>Purchases.</strong> When you buy, Paddle, as Merchant of Record, collects your name, email address, billing country, payment details, and tax information. Paddle is an independent controller of that data and handles it under its own privacy notice. Paddle shares with us your email address, order number, country, and what you bought, so we can deliver your report, support you, and keep business records. Basis: performing our contract with you; our legal obligations (such as accounting and tax).</p>

    <h2>4. Who we share data with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Cloudflare, which hosts and secures the Site.</li>
      <li>Paddle, which processes payments, taxes, and refunds as Merchant of Record.</li>
      <li>Alibaba Cloud, whose business email service handles messages sent to and from hello@harborwish.com.</li>
      <li>Professional advisers, such as lawyers and accountants, where we need their help.</li>
      <li>Public authorities, where the law requires it.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We don’t share your personal data for advertising.</p>

    <h2>5. International transfers</h2>
    <p>We are based in China, and our providers operate in many countries, so your data may be processed outside the country where you live, including in China, the United States, and the United Kingdom. Where the law requires safeguards for these transfers, we use appropriate ones, such as standard contractual clauses or an adequacy decision.</p>

    <h2>6. How long we keep data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Messages: for as long as we need to handle your request and any follow-up, then we delete or anonymize them.</li>
      <li>Purchase records: for as long as accounting, tax, and other legal obligations require.</li>
      <li>Technical request data: we don’t keep our own copy of visitor logs. Cloudflare keeps the data it processes under its own policies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, including in the UK and the European Economic Area, you may have the right to access your personal data, correct it, erase it, restrict how we use it, receive a portable copy, and object to our processing. Where we rely on your consent, you can withdraw it at any time. You also have the right to complain to your local data protection authority. To use any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:hello@harborwish.com">hello@harborwish.com</a>. We’ll respond within one month. For data that Paddle holds, please contact Paddle.</p>

    <h2>8. Security</h2>
    <p>We use appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data. No system is perfectly secure, but we take care to limit what we collect and who can reach it.</p>

    <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We don’t use cookies or similar technologies on the Site for analytics, advertising, or tracking. If you open Paddle’s checkout, Paddle may set cookies it needs to process your payment, as described in Paddle’s own notice.</p>

    <h2>10. Children</h2>
    <p>Harborwish is not for anyone under 16, and we don’t knowingly collect data from children. If you think a child has sent us personal data, email us and we’ll delete it.</p>

    <h2>11. Changes to this notice</h2>
    <p>We’ll update this notice when our practices change, and show the “Last updated” date above. If we make a significant change, we’ll say so on the Site.</p>

    <h2>12. Contact us</h2>
    <p>Privacy questions or requests: <a href="mailto:hello@harborwish.com">hello@harborwish.com</a>, or write to Shenyang Ruandi Technology Co., Ltd, Room 7-8387, 7th Floor, No. 39-4 Chuangxin 2nd Road, Taoxian Subdistrict, Shenyang Area of China (Liaoning) Pilot Free Trade Zone, Shenyang, Liaoning Province, China, 110179.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
